* HEXCOM - CONVERT INTEL HEX TO COM

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* HEXCOM - CONVERT INTEL HEX TO COM

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    SYSUTLS:HEXCOM filename

Reads filename.HEX and produces filename.COM. Example: SYSUTLS:HEXCOM
I0:DEMO

Reports malformed records, checksum errors and load-address problems.
Preserve the source HEX file and check the generated program before
executing it. This is a conversion step, not an assembler or linker.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
